<urn:usf:supersession:self-host-profile-lineage:1> <urn:usf:predicate:activePathStatus> "The current self-host lane is graph/manifests/self-host-provider-v3.json bound to urn:usf:profile:v3-self-host:3, which reads nine of nine verified-complete. Lanes bound to revision 1 or revision 2 are closed selection boundaries and are not a work backlog." <urn:usf:graph:foundation> .
<urn:usf:supersession:self-host-profile-lineage:1> <urn:usf:predicate:historicalStatus> "Grants, receipts and completions recorded under the superseded profiles remain valid as history. They are not recycled, reinterpreted or re-dated to make the transition appear continuous. Four works reachable only from the superseded lanes carry no publication policy anywhere in the corpus and therefore cannot complete under any profile; that is recorded here rather than repaired." <urn:usf:graph:foundation> .
